<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The College ideally located on either side with planned roads connecting National High Way in the heart of the heritage city of Mysore, a cleanest city, a popular tourist destination with salubrious weather throughout the year, a booming metropolitan city with an airport connecting major cities in India; Quality Education at affordable fees; Experienced, qualified and committed faculty; Core specializations offered; Corporate grooming; Internship facilitating practical learning; Digital learning with supportive infrastructure; Industry-Academic interaction; Placement oriented training programmes; Wi-Fi enabled and CCTV surveillance campus. An excellent Hostel facility within the college campus is available for the girls. Insurance covered for all the students and the staff. A new mofussil, intercity and interstate bus terminal is being created right in front of the college by the State Government to the convenience of the students creating easy access to the college anytime of the day. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [39]
